/*  A helper appends to the series it is given. Called inside a rabbit, on a series from outside.
    Obligation broken: O4, what a function stores into its parameters is its caller's business. See docs/SOUNDNESS.md.  */

Bind void to add-some, given (the series of number bag):
    Define n as 0.
    While n is less than 40, repeat:
        Insert n into bag.
        n becomes n + 1.
    Done.
Done.
Define totals as a series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    Cast add-some on (totals).
Done.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State totals.
